---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - Dujiangyan Panda Base Guide"
  description="Privacy policy for Dujiangyan Panda Base Guide. Learn about how we handle your data and protect your privacy when using our website."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-accent-600 uppercase mb-3">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-warm-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-warm-500">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-warm-700 leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-warm-900">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        Dujiangyan Panda Base Guide is a static informational website. We do not use cookies, tracking scripts, analytics software, or any other form of data collection. We do not collect, store, or process any personal information from visitors to this website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-warm-900">2. Email Communication</h2>
      <p>
        If you choose to contact us via email at hello@dujiangyan-panda-base.com, we will only use your email address to respond to your inquiry. We do not add your email address to any mailing list, newsletter, or marketing database. We do not share your email address or any correspondence with third parties.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-warm-900">3. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>
        Our website contains links to external websites such as Trip.com, Wikipedia, and UNESCO. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these third-party sites. We recommend reviewing the privacy policies of any external sites you visit.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-warm-900">4. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our website is intended for general audiences and does not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information via email, please contact us and we will delete it promptly.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-warm-900">5. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-warm-900">6. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@dujiangyan-panda-base.com" class="text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700 underline">hello@dujiangyan-panda-base.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
